OL,3,GNEWSATwo drivers jailed after friend   
OL,4,Adrowns in crash                        
OL,6,FTwo drivers who admitted the           
OL,7,Fmanslaughter of their friend who       
OL,8,Fdrowned in a water-filled ditch        
OL,9,Ffollowing a crash have been jailed.    
OL,11,FSean Burlton, 28, was a passenger in a 
OL,12,Fcar which was involved in a collision  
OL,13,Fon Counter Drain Drove, in Tongue End, 
OL,14,FLincolnshire, on 24 November 2023.     
OL,16,FLincoln Crown Court heard Burlton was  
OL,17,Fone of seven men in two cars, one of   
OL,18,Fwhich had tried to ram a VW Touran     
OL,19,Fbeing driven by his girlfriend's       
OL,20,Fex-partner, before leaving the road and
OL,21,Fentering the water.                    
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
