OL,3,GNEWSATwo drivers jailed after friend   
OL,4,Adrowns in crash                        
OL,6,FThe two drivers of the cars, Bailey    
OL,7,FFitzgerald and Sam Johnson, each       
OL,8,Fpleaded guilty to manslaughter.        
OL,9,FFitzgerald was jailed for four years   
OL,10,Fand eight months, while Johnson was    
OL,11,Fjailed for five years and seven months.
